notes = "The real Elemental Affinity resistance member explicitly reuses the delivered five Dragon Resistance body lifecycles. Each source keeps its exact damage_type predicate and calibration; the real alias condition UUID, recipient, public state and application/removal age own playback. The finite affinity action source remains separate. Imported affinity marker/response strips are unselected provenance, not an inferred response event. This is an unqualified source reuse choice; all artwork remains unreviewed."
